sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Authorized Safety Manager
    participant App as Application
    participant MH as MonitoringHandler
    participant CW as CameraWorker
    participant Det as Detector
    participant MS as MonitorState

    M->>App: Open live monitor
    App->>MH: Request camera stream and status
    loop For each camera frame
        CW->>Det: Detect, track, and build feature vectors
        alt Detector returns normally
            Det-->>CW: Detections, track IDs, vectors
            CW->>MS: Update frame, counts, and risk status
            MH-->>App: Stream annotated frame and status
        else Detector error, camera still delivering frames
            Det--xCW: Error
            CW->>MS: Set state to Degraded, risk unavailable
            MH-->>App: Stream raw frame with degraded-mode status
            App-->>M: Show "risk analysis unavailable" banner
        else Camera stops returning frames
            CW->>MS: Set state to Failed
            MH-->>App: Monitoring failed
            App-->>M: Show camera-failure message
        end
    end